5.1.0, still degraded, and still at an 18% error rate.\n\nIt may just need more time to recover now that the worker is fixed, or its own v5.1.0 release may also be at fault. I haven't touched it. Check again in a few minutes, and if it's still erroring, I can roll payments-api back to v5.0.0, its last release that was healthy in production. That wouldn't need change-manager approval. Just say if you want me to.", "type": "text"}]}]}